        <mxCell id="c65" value="Sessions: &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;sessions/&amp;lt;label&amp;gt;/last-session.debriefproj&lt;/span&gt; per window (it names the store folder to reopen) + &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;sessions/manifest.json&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;{version 2}&lt;/span&gt;; a missing or corrupt manifest falls back to scanning the folders; a v1 last session is recovered as main. Separate instances (&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;--new-instance&lt;/span&gt;, safe mode) never get a recovery offer; safe mode starts without plugins and with the built-in profile." style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="910" width="900" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
